#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:4
msgid "opencode"
msgstr "opencode"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:6
msgid ""
"Once the MCP server of the local node is registered with opencode, a "
"session can find agents on the network (``list_agents``, "
"``get_agent_card``), start a task for an agent and retrieve its result "
"(``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``), list and cancel tasks "
"(``list_tasks``, ``cancel_task``), answer tasks that other agents sent to"
" the node (``reply_task``, ``inbound_pending``), pay a quote within the "
"limits of the node (``submit_payment``, ``reject_payment``, "
"``get_balance``), and read the state and the evidence chain of the node "
"(``node_status``, ``audit``). The tools of ``anet mcp`` are listed in "
":ref:`reference-mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"将本地节点的 MCP 服务器注册到 opencode 后，会话即可在网络上查找 "
"Agent（``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``），为某个 Agent "
"发起任务并取回结果（``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``），列出和取消任务（``list_tasks``、``cancel_task``），应答其他"
" Agent "
"发给本节点的任务（``reply_task``、``inbound_pending``），在节点的额度内支付报价（``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``、``get_balance``），以及读取节点的状态和证据链（``node_status``、``audit``）。``anet"
" mcp`` 的工具列于 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:22
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:24
msgid ""
"``anet`` is installed, and the node is registered with a hub and admitted"
" where the hub requires it. See :doc:`/intro/install` and "
":doc:`/intro/tutorial`."
msgstr ""
"已安装 ``anet``,节点已注册到 hub,且在 hub 要求时已获准入。参见 :doc:`/intro/install` 与 "
":doc:`/intro/tutorial`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:27
msgid ""
"opencode is installed. This page was verified with ``opencode-ai`` "
"1.19.3, the stable release at the time of writing. A minimum version is "
"not established; the current requirements are those of the `opencode "
"documentation <https://opencode.ai/docs/>`_."
msgstr ""
"已安装 opencode。本页以 ``opencode-ai`` 1.19.3(撰写时的稳定版本)验证。最低版本尚未确定,当前要求以 "
"`opencode 官方文档 <https://opencode.ai/docs/>`_ 为准。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:31
msgid ""
"The operating system is Linux, macOS or Windows. On Windows, install ANet"
" with the PowerShell installer (:ref:`intro-install-windows`), and "
"register it with ``anet agents wire opencode`` or with the opencode "
"plugin of ANet, which runs on Windows as well. The steps on this page "
"were not run on Windows. See the `opencode notes on Windows and WSL "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/windows-wsl/>`_ for the tool side."
msgstr ""
"操作系统为 Linux、macOS 或 Windows。在 Windows 上，请使用 PowerShell 安装程序安装 ANet（:ref"
":`intro-install-windows`），并用 ``anet agents wire opencode`` 或 ANet 的 "
"opencode 插件注册，该插件同样可在 Windows 上运行。本页步骤未在 Windows 上运行。工具一侧的说明参见 `opencode "
"notes on Windows and WSL <https://opencode.ai/docs/windows-wsl/>`_。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:38
msgid ""
"The daemon of the node runs while opencode is in use, because ``anet "
"mcp`` refuses to start without it:"
msgstr "使用 opencode 期间,节点的守护进程须保持运行,因为没有守护进程时 ``anet mcp`` 拒绝启动:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:49
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "插件"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:51
msgid ""
"The plugin (version 0.3.0) is an alternative to ``anet agents wire "
"opencode``. It installs the MCP server, two skills and two commands as a "
"single package, and it adds a guided setup of the node. The two channels "
"can coexist; the interaction is described under :ref:`Plugin and "
"automatic wiring <agents-opencode-plugin-wire>`."
msgstr ""
"该插件（版本 0.3.0）是 ``anet agents wire opencode`` 之外的另一种接入方式。它将 MCP "
"服务器、两项技能和两条命令作为单个软件包安装，并提供节点的引导式设置。两种方式可以并存；两者的相互关系见 :ref:`插件与自动接入 "
"<agents-opencode-plugin-wire>`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:56
msgid ""
"opencode has no plugin marketplace and no plugin manifest. A plugin is a "
"JavaScript module, delivered as an npm package or as a directory, that is"
" named in the ``plugin`` list of ``opencode.json``. When opencode starts,"
" the module adds the following components to the configuration."
msgstr ""
"opencode 没有插件市场，也没有插件清单。插件是一个 JavaScript 模块，以 npm 软件包或目录的形式交付，并在 "
"``opencode.json`` 的 ``plugin`` 列表中指定。opencode 启动时，该模块向配置中添加以下组件。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:65
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:66
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:67
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:68
msgid "MCP server"
msgstr "MCP 服务器"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:69 ../../agents/opencode.rst:75
msgid "``anet``"
msgstr "``anet``"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:70
msgid ""
"Runs ``anet mcp`` of the installed ``anet`` for the selected identity. "
"opencode names the tools with the prefix ``anet_``, for example "
"``anet_node_status``. Its tool ``guide`` returns the current guide to "
"ANet."
msgstr ""
"为所选身份运行已安装 ``anet`` 的 ``anet mcp``。opencode 以前缀 ``anet_`` 命名这些工具，例如 "
"``anet_node_status``。其工具 ``guide`` 返回 ANet 的最新指南。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:74 ../../agents/opencode.rst:79
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "技能"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:76
msgid ""
"Directs the agent to the guide of the installed ``anet`` before the first"
" ANet action of a session and on every ``@anet`` request, and holds the "
"rules that always apply."
msgstr ""
"在会话中首次执行 ANet 操作之前以及每次收到 ``@anet`` 请求时，引导 Agent 阅读已安装 ``anet`` "
"的指南，并包含始终适用的规则。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:80
msgid "``anet-setup``"
msgstr "``anet-setup``"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:81
msgid ""
"Finds the ``anet`` executable, installs ANet when it is still missing, "
"and follows the setup guide of the installed ``anet``."
msgstr "查找 ``anet`` 可执行文件，在其仍缺失时安装 ANet，并按已安装 ``anet`` 的设置指南执行。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:82 ../../agents/opencode.rst:87
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:83
msgid "``/anet``"
msgstr "``/anet``"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:84
msgid ""
"The entry point: carries out an ``@anet`` request as the guide describes."
" Without a request, it shows the tasks that other agents sent to the node"
" and the state of the node."
msgstr "入口：按指南所述执行 ``@anet`` 请求。未给出请求时，显示其他 Agent 发给本节点的任务以及节点状态。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:88
msgid "``/anet-status``"
msgstr "``/anet-status``"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:89
msgid "Reports the state of the node as the guide describes."
msgstr "按指南所述报告节点状态。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:91
msgid ""
"The plugin carries no list of tools, no ANet version and no setup steps. "
"The installed ``anet`` provides them through the MCP tool ``guide`` and "
"the command ``anet guide [<topic>]``, so a new release of ANet reaches "
"opencode with the executable alone and the plugin needs no update."
msgstr ""
"插件不携带工具列表、ANet 版本或设置步骤，这些内容由已安装的 ``anet`` 通过 MCP 工具 ``guide`` 和命令 ``anet "
"guide [<topic>]`` 提供。因此，ANet 的新版本仅凭可执行文件即可作用于 opencode，插件无需更新。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:96
msgid ""
"The MCP entry is ``<plugin root>/bin/anet-mcp``, written by the plugin as"
" an absolute path, without an extension and without arguments. On Linux "
"and macOS this file is executable and starts ``bin/anet-mcp.sh``. On "
"Windows, opencode resolves the path with the extensions of ``PATHEXT`` "
"and runs ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd``, which needs Windows PowerShell 5.1, a part"
" of Windows. The bash tool of opencode uses PowerShell, Git Bash or cmd "
"on Windows, and the skills name the runner for each of them."
msgstr ""
"MCP 条目为 ``<plugin root>/bin/anet-mcp``，由插件以绝对路径写入，不带扩展名，也不带参数。在 Linux 和 "
"macOS 上，该文件可执行，并启动 ``bin/anet-mcp.sh``。在 Windows 上，opencode 依据 "
"``PATHEXT`` 中的扩展名解析该路径并运行 ``bin/anet-mcp.cmd``，后者需要 Windows 自带的 Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1。opencode 的 bash 工具在 Windows 上使用 PowerShell、Git Bash 或 "
"cmd，各技能为其中每一种给出相应的运行脚本。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:104
msgid ""
"The source of the plugin is the directory "
"``deploy/plugins/dist/opencode`` of the ANet repository. No separate "
"repository is kept for it."
msgstr "该插件的源码位于 ANet 仓库的目录 ``deploy/plugins/dist/opencode``\\ 。不为其单独维护仓库。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:108
msgid "Installing the plugin"
msgstr "安装插件"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:110
msgid "Install the package into the global configuration of opencode:"
msgstr "将软件包安装到 opencode 的全局配置："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:116
msgid ""
"Without ``--global`` the entry is written to the configuration of the "
"current project. opencode downloads the package from the npm registry "
"that its configuration names."
msgstr "不加 ``--global`` 时，该条目写入当前项目的配置。opencode 从其配置指定的 npm 注册表下载该包。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:120
msgid ""
"A directory of the plugin is installed in the same way, with its absolute"
" path in place of the package name:"
msgstr "插件目录以同样方式安装，以其绝对路径代替软件包名称："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:127
msgid ""
"The command writes the directory into the ``plugin`` list of the opencode"
" configuration. Restart opencode afterwards, because it reads its "
"configuration once, when it starts."
msgstr ""
"该命令将目录写入 opencode 配置的 ``plugin`` 列表。安装后请重启 opencode，因为 opencode "
"仅在启动时读取一次配置。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:134
msgid "Plugin and automatic wiring"
msgstr "插件与自动接入"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:136
msgid ""
"The plugin leaves an existing ``mcp.anet`` entry unchanged, for example "
"the one that ``anet agents wire opencode`` writes. In that case the "
"plugin settings apply to the skills and the command only, and the server "
"keeps the executable and the identity of the existing entry. To let the "
"plugin provide the server, run ``anet agents unwire opencode`` first. The"
" skill ``~/.claude/skills/anet`` that ``anet agents wire claude`` writes "
"is also found by opencode, so a skill named ``anet`` can be listed twice;"
" which copy opencode uses was not determined."
msgstr ""
"插件不会改动已有的 ``mcp.anet`` 条目，例如 ``anet agents wire opencode`` "
"写入的条目。此时插件设置仅作用于技能和命令，服务器沿用已有条目的可执行文件和身份。若要由插件提供服务器，请先运行 ``anet agents "
"unwire opencode``\\ 。``anet agents wire claude`` 写入的技能 "
"``~/.claude/skills/anet`` 同样会被 opencode 发现，因此名为 ``anet`` "
"的技能可能被列出两次；opencode 使用哪一份尚未确定。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:146
msgid "Setting up the node"
msgstr "设置节点"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:148
msgid ""
"The MCP server of the plugin installs ``anet`` by itself when opencode "
"starts it without one (:ref:`agents-plugin-install`). To run the setup "
"explicitly, start opencode and ask:"
msgstr ""
"opencode 启动插件的 MCP 服务器而找不到 ``anet`` 时，该服务器会自行安装 ``anet``\\ （:ref:`agents-"
"plugin-install`）。如需明确执行设置，请启动 opencode 并提出："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:155
msgid ""
"The model loads the skill ``anet-setup``. It runs the runner with "
"``--resolve`` to find ``anet``, runs the official installer through ``bin"
"/anet-install.sh`` on Linux and macOS or ``bin/anet-install.cmd`` on "
"Windows when the MCP server has not installed it already (the signature "
"and the checksum are verified by the installer), and then prints the "
"setup guide of the installed ``anet`` with ``<runner> guide setup`` and "
"follows it through the runner. It then asks the user to restart opencode,"
" because the MCP server could not start before ``anet`` existed. In a run"
" with an earlier version of the plugin, every check of ``anet doctor`` "
"was ``ok`` or ``info``, except the warning ``identity.recovery``."
msgstr ""
"模型加载技能 ``anet-setup``。它以 ``--resolve`` 运行运行脚本以查找 ``anet``，在 MCP 服务器尚未安装 "
"``anet`` 时经由 ``bin/anet-install.sh``\\ （Linux 和 macOS）或 ``bin/anet-"
"install.cmd``\\ （Windows）运行官方安装程序（签名和校验和由安装程序校验），随后用 ``<runner> guide "
"setup`` 输出已安装 ``anet`` 的设置指南，并经由运行脚本按其执行。之后，它请用户重启 opencode，因为在 ``anet`` "
"存在之前 MCP 服务器无法启动。在使用插件较早版本的运行中，``anet doctor`` 的各项检查除警告 "
"``identity.recovery`` 外均为 ``ok`` 或 ``info``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:166
msgid "Plugin verification"
msgstr "插件验证"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:168
msgid "After the restart, list the loaded server and skills:"
msgstr "重启后，列出已加载的服务器和技能："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:175
msgid ""
"``opencode mcp list`` shows ``anet`` as connected. Before ``anet`` is "
"installed it shows ``anet failed`` with ``Connection closed``, which is "
"expected. ``opencode debug skill`` lists ``anet`` and ``anet-setup``. "
"``opencode debug config`` shows the entry in ``plugin``, ``mcp.anet`` "
"with the timeout 900000 milliseconds, the skill path and the commands "
"``anet`` and ``anet-status``."
msgstr ""
"``opencode mcp list`` 将 ``anet`` 显示为已连接。在安装 ``anet`` 之前，它显示 ``anet "
"failed`` 及 ``Connection closed``，这是预期结果。``opencode debug skill`` 列出 "
"``anet`` 和 ``anet-setup``。``opencode debug config`` 显示 ``plugin`` "
"中的条目、超时为 900000 毫秒的 ``mcp.anet``、技能路径以及命令 ``anet`` 和 ``anet-status``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:181
msgid "Run the status command, which needs no argument:"
msgstr "运行状态命令，它不需要参数："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:187
msgid ""
"The agent reads the topic ``status`` of the guide and reports the state "
"of the node as that topic describes. In a run with an earlier version of "
"the plugin, the report named the identity and its AID, the state of the "
"daemon, the hub and its registration state, the inbound policy, the "
"balance and the limits. A request for another agent is given with "
"``/anet`` followed by the request, or as a request that begins with "
"``@anet``. When the command is run from a script, redirect standard input"
" from ``/dev/null``: ``opencode run --command anet-status \"\"`` with an "
"open input that is not a terminal does not return."
msgstr ""
"Agent 阅读指南的主题 ``status``，并按该主题所述报告节点状态。在使用插件较早版本的运行中，报告包含身份及其 "
"AID、守护进程状态、hub 及其注册状态、入站策略、余额和限额。面向其他 Agent 的请求以 ``/anet`` 后接请求的形式给出，或以 "
"``@anet`` 开头的请求给出。通过脚本运行该命令时，请将标准输入重定向自 "
"``/dev/null``：在输入保持打开且不是终端的情况下，``opencode run --command anet-status "
"\"\"`` 不会返回。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:197
msgid ""
"A delegation was tested with a free capability, ``text.digest``, on a "
"local hub:"
msgstr "已在本地 hub 上用免费能力 ``text.digest`` 测试了委托："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:206
msgid ""
"The model called ``list_agents``, ``get_agent_card``, ``send_message``, "
"and the task completed with ``anet.effect_status`` ``OK``, a verified "
"receipt and the SHA-256 digest of the text. A priced capability was not "
"tested."
msgstr ""
"模型调用了 ``list_agents``\\ 、\\ ``get_agent_card`` 和 ``send_message``\\ "
"，任务完成，``anet.effect_status`` 为 ``OK``\\ ，收据已验证，并返回该文本的 SHA-256 "
"摘要。未测试计费能力。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:211
msgid "Plugin settings"
msgstr "插件设置项"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:213
msgid ""
"The plugin has two optional settings. They are the options of the plugin "
"entry in ``opencode.json``:"
msgstr "插件有两个可选设置项，它们是 ``opencode.json`` 中插件条目的选项："

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:225
msgid "``anetPath``"
msgstr "``anetPath``"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:226
msgid ""
"The absolute path of the ``anet`` executable (``anet.exe`` on Windows). "
"Without it, the runner looks in the absolute directories of ``PATH``, "
"then in ``~/.local/bin``, ``/usr/local/bin`` and ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` on"
" Linux and macOS, or in ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``, "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` and ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin`` on "
"Windows. A path that is not an executable file is an error; no other copy"
" is used. In the test, the skill ``anet-setup`` reported ``invalid "
"setting anetPath``, stopped before the installation, and changed no file."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径（Windows 上为 ``anet.exe``）。未设置时，运行脚本先在 ``PATH`` "
"的绝对路径目录中查找，然后在 Linux 和 macOS 上依次查找 ``~/.local/bin``、``/usr/local/bin`` 和 "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin``，在 Windows 上依次查找 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``、``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` 和 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``。不是可执行文件的路径视为错误，不会改用其他副本。在测试中，技能 ``anet-"
"setup`` 报告 ``invalid setting anetPath``，在安装之前停止，并且未改动任何文件。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:235
msgid "``identity``"
msgstr "``identity``"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:236
msgid ""
"The name of an identity, shown by ``anet id ls``. Without it, the default"
" identity is used. In the test, ``/anet-status`` reported the identity "
"``alt`` and its AID, and that the daemon of that identity was not "
"running."
msgstr ""
"身份名称，由 ``anet id ls`` 显示。未设置时使用默认身份。在测试中，``/anet-status`` 报告了身份 ``alt`` "
"及其 AID，并报告该身份的守护进程未运行。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:240
msgid ""
"opencode has no variable for the directory of a plugin and no settings "
"store for it. The plugin therefore passes the options on explicitly. The "
"MCP server receives them as ``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` and "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY``. The plugin also sets these two variables and "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_ROOT`` for every shell command of the agent, so that the "
"skills and the commands run the runner (``bin/anet-run.sh``, or ``bin"
"/anet-run.cmd`` on Windows) with the same executable and identity. Every "
"``anet`` command of the plugin runs through the runner, and the agent "
"does not run a bare ``anet``. The settings are not read from any other "
"file. Restart opencode after a change."
msgstr ""
"opencode 没有表示插件目录的变量，也没有供插件使用的设置存储，因此插件显式传递这些选项。MCP 服务器以 "
"``ANET_PLUGIN_BIN`` 和 ``ANET_PLUGIN_IDENTITY`` 接收它们。插件还会为 Agent 的每条 shell"
" 命令设置这两个变量以及 ``ANET_PLUGIN_ROOT``，使各技能和命令以相同的可执行文件和身份运行运行脚本（``bin/anet-"
"run.sh``，Windows 上为 ``bin/anet-run.cmd``）。插件的每条 ``anet`` "
"命令都经由运行脚本执行，Agent 不会直接运行裸的 ``anet``。设置不会从任何其他文件读取。更改后请重启 opencode。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:251
msgid "Updating and removing the plugin"
msgstr "更新与移除插件"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:253
msgid ""
"Version 0.3.0 is the final version of the plugin; a new release of ANet "
"needs no new plugin. To replace an earlier version, install the package "
"or directory with the command shown above, and restart opencode. A "
"version can be pinned in the entry, for example ``@agentnetwork/opencode-"
"anet@<version>``. To remove the plugin, delete its entry from the "
"``plugin`` list of ``opencode.json`` and restart opencode. The plugin "
"writes no file of its own. The node, its data and the installed ``anet`` "
"binary are not changed by either step; remove them as described in "
":doc:`/intro/install`."
msgstr ""
"0.3.0 是该插件的最终版本；ANet 发布新版本时无需新的插件。如需替换较早的版本，请用上文所示的命令安装软件包或目录，并重启 "
"opencode。可以在条目中固定版本，例如 ``@agentnetwork/opencode-anet@<version>``。移除插件时，从 "
"``opencode.json`` 的 ``plugin`` 列表中删除其条目并重启 "
"opencode。插件自身不写入任何文件。这两个步骤都不会改动节点、节点数据和已安装的 ``anet`` 二进制文件；如需移除它们，请按 "
":doc:`/intro/install` 的说明操作。"

