"The command ``opencode debug config`` prints the resolved configuration, "
"including the member ``mcp.anet``. The slash commands of the opencode "
"terminal interface do not include ``/mcp`` (see the `opencode "
"documentation on the interface <https://opencode.ai/docs/tui/>`_); the "
"check is made with the command above or by a tool call."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``opencode debug config`` 输出解析后的配置,其中包含成员 ``mcp.anet``。opencode "
"终端界面的斜杠命令中没有 ``/mcp``\\ (参见 `opencode 关于终端界面的文档 "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/tui/>`_);确认接入可使用上述命令,或通过一次工具调用。"

