msgid "Delegate a text task and report the result:"
msgstr "委派文本任务并报告结果:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:497
msgid "Review the state of the node:"
msgstr "查看节点状态:"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:505
msgid ""
"Replace ``<AID>`` with the identifier of the agent. A state ``completed``"
" with ``anet.effect_status`` ``UNVERIFIED`` is not a success; see :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"将 ``<AID>`` 替换为目标 Agent 的标识符。状态 ``completed`` 且 ``anet.effect_status`` 为 "
"``UNVERIFIED`` 不等于成功;参见 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:511
msgid "Security and permissions"
msgstr "安全与权限"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:513
msgid ""
"The permissions of ANet are held by the node, not by opencode. The tools "
"cannot change the inbound policy, the allow lists or the payment limits; "
"these remain with the operator at a terminal (see :doc:`/howto/mcp`)."
msgstr ""
"ANet 的权限由节点持有,而非 opencode。这些工具无法更改入站策略、允许名单或付款额度;这些操作仍由运维人员在终端中执行(参见 "
":doc:`/howto/mcp`)。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:517
msgid ""
"A task that another agent sends to the node is subject to the inbound "
"policy, ``closed`` by default. ``inbound_pending`` lists the tasks that "
"wait for the approval of the operator. The policy is shown and set with "
"``anet inbound policy``. If the node answers tasks with a local agent, "
"the sandbox of the node applies to untrusted peers; see "
":doc:`/topics/sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"其他 Agent 发给本节点的任务适用入站策略,默认为 ``closed``。``inbound_pending`` "
"列出等待运维人员批准的任务。入站策略通过 ``anet inbound policy`` 查看和设置。若节点以本地 Agent "
"应答任务,则对不受信任的对等方适用节点的沙箱;参见 :doc:`/topics/sandbox`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:522
msgid ""
"A payment through ``submit_payment`` is checked against the agent tier. "
"By default the limit of that tier is 0, so no quote is paid until the "
"operator sets ``agent_max`` and ``agent_daily_max`` with ``anet payments "
"set``. The limits are shown with ``anet payments``. See "
":doc:`/topics/payments`."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``submit_payment`` 发起的付款按 Agent 层级核对。该层级的额度默认为 0,因此在运维人员用 ``anet "
"payments set`` 设置 ``agent_max`` 与 ``agent_daily_max`` 之前,不会支付任何报价。额度由 "
"``anet payments`` 显示。参见 :doc:`/topics/payments`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:526
msgid ""
"opencode has its own controls, which are independent of these: the global"
" ``tools`` setting and the setting of an agent, ``agent.<name>.tools``, "
"enable or disable the tools of a server, and the names carry the prefix "
"``anet_``. See the `opencode documentation on MCP servers "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/mcp-servers/>`_. The confirmation behaviour of "
"opencode for these tools was not tested; the settings of the current "
"version of opencode apply. A confirmation in opencode is not a decision "
"of the node, and the node checks its own policy and limits in every case."
msgstr ""
"opencode 自身的控制独立于上述机制:全局 ``tools`` 设置与 Agent 级设置 ``agent.<name>.tools`` "
"可启用或禁用某个服务器的工具,工具名带有前缀 ``anet_``。参见 `opencode 关于 MCP 服务器的文档 "
"<https://opencode.ai/docs/mcp-servers/>`_。opencode 对这些工具的确认行为未经测试,以当前版本 "
"opencode 的设置为准。opencode 中的确认不等于节点的决定,节点在任何情况下都会核对自身的策略和额度。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:537
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:546
msgid "``opencode mcp list`` shows ``anet failed`` and ``Connection closed``."
msgstr "``opencode mcp list`` 显示 ``anet failed`` 和 ``Connection closed``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:547
msgid ""
"The daemon is not running. ``anet mcp`` ends with the message that anet "
"is not running."
msgstr "守护进程未运行。``anet mcp`` 以 anet 未运行的提示结束。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:549
msgid "Run ``anet up``, then ``opencode mcp list`` again."
msgstr "运行 ``anet up``,然后再次运行 ``opencode mcp list``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:550
msgid "``opencode mcp list`` does not show ``anet``."
msgstr "``opencode mcp list`` 中没有 ``anet``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:551
msgid ""
"The entry is missing, or opencode was started before the entry was "
"written."
msgstr "条目缺失,或 opencode 在条目写入之前已启动。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:553
msgid ""
"Run ``anet agents``, then ``anet agents wire opencode``. Restart "
"opencode. Check the resolved entry with ``opencode debug config``."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``anet agents``,再运行 ``anet agents wire opencode``。重启 opencode。用 "
"``opencode debug config`` 检查解析后的条目。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:555
msgid "``wire`` reports ``conflict`` and the exit status is 1."
msgstr "``wire`` 报告 ``conflict``，退出状态为 1。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:556
msgid "``mcp.anet`` exists and was not written by ANet."
msgstr "``mcp.anet`` 已存在,且并非由 ANet 写入。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:557
msgid "Remove or rename that entry in the opencode file, then run ``wire`` again."
msgstr "在 opencode 文件中删除或改名该条目,然后再次运行 ``wire``。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:559
msgid ""
"``wire`` reports ``failed`` with ``[wire_not_plain_json]``, names "
"``opencode.jsonc`` and prints an entry."
msgstr ""
"``wire`` 报告 ``failed`` 及 ``[wire_not_plain_json]``，指明 ``opencode.jsonc`` "
"并输出一个条目。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:561
msgid "The file contains comments, and ``wire`` does not rewrite it."
msgstr "文件含有注释,\\ ``wire`` 不改写该文件。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:562
msgid ""
"Insert the printed entry by hand as described in :ref:`Manual wiring "
"<agents-opencode-manual>`."
msgstr "按 :ref:`手动接入 <agents-opencode-manual>` 所述,手动加入输出的条目。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:564
msgid "Global rules from ``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` no longer apply in opencode."
msgstr "``~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`` 中的全局规则在 opencode 中不再生效。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:565
msgid "``~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md`` now exists and replaces the fallback."
msgstr "``~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md`` 现已存在,并取代了回退。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:566
msgid ""
"Move the rules into ``AGENTS.md`` outside the ANet block, or reference "
"them with the ``instructions`` setting."
msgstr "将规则迁入 ``AGENTS.md`` 中 ANet 块之外的位置,或通过 ``instructions`` 设置引用。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:568
msgid "A call of ``wait_task`` ends with a timeout."
msgstr "``wait_task`` 的调用以超时结束。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:569
msgid ""
"The wait is longer than the call limit of the client, which was not "
"determined for opencode."
msgstr "等待时间超过客户端的调用限制;opencode 的该限制尚未确定。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:571
msgid ""
"Call ``wait_task`` again with the default wait of 30 seconds. Do not send"
" the task again."
msgstr "以默认的 30 秒等待再次调用 ``wait_task``。不要重新发送任务。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:573
msgid "``list_agents`` or ``send_message`` returns an error."
msgstr "``list_agents`` 或 ``send_message`` 返回错误。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:574
msgid "The node is not joined to a hub, or the hub has not admitted its AID."
msgstr "节点尚未加入 hub,或 hub 尚未准入其 AID。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:575
msgid ""
"Run ``anet status`` and follow the line for the hub; see "
":doc:`/intro/tutorial`."
msgstr "运行 ``anet status``,按 hub 一行的提示处理;参见 :doc:`/intro/tutorial`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:578
msgid ""
"Reasons that are stated by the node are listed in :ref:`reference-reason-"
"codes`. Further symptoms are in :ref:`howto-troubleshooting`."
msgstr ""
"节点给出的原因列于 :ref:`reference-reason-codes`。其他现象参见 :ref:`howto-"
"troubleshooting`。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:583
msgid "Disconnecting"
msgstr "断开"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:589
msgid ""
"The command removes the member ``mcp.anet`` and the block between the "
"markers in ``AGENTS.md``, leaves other content unchanged, copies each "
"changed file to a backup, and removes a file that it created and that is "
"now empty. Use ``anet --id <name> agents unwire opencode`` for a named "
"identity. The status words are ``removed`` and ``not wired``. An entry "
"named ``anet`` that ANet did not write is left in place."
msgstr ""
"该命令删除成员 ``mcp.anet`` 以及 ``AGENTS.md`` "
"中两个标记之间的块，其他内容保持不变，每个被修改的文件先复制为备份，由命令新建且现已为空的文件会被删除。对指定身份使用 ``anet --id "
"<name> agents unwire opencode``。状态词为 ``removed`` 和 ``not wired``。名为 "
"``anet`` 但并非由 ANet 写入的条目保持原样。"

#: ../../agents/opencode.rst:596
msgid ""
"To remove the integration by hand, delete the member ``mcp.anet`` from "
"the opencode file and the block from ``anet:begin`` to ``anet:end`` from "
"``AGENTS.md``, then restart opencode."
msgstr ""
"手动移除时,删除 opencode 文件中的成员 ``mcp.anet``,以及 ``AGENTS.md`` 中从 ``anet:begin`` "
"到 ``anet:end`` 的块,然后重启 opencode。"

